## Tools Used

- Power BI
- DAX
- Excel

---

## DAX Measures

- Total Employees
- Attrition Count
- Attrition Rate
- Average Salary
- Average Performance

---

## Key Insights

- Finance department has the highest attrition.
- Average employee salary is approximately ₹11 lakh.
- Overall attrition rate is 17.4%.
- Gender distribution is almost balanced.

